<Project>

  <!--
    作用：所有子项目自动继承的公共构建设置，避免每个 .csproj 重复声明同一份配置。
    Purpose: Shared build settings inherited by every project, so the same configuration is not repeated in each .csproj.

    刻意**不**放在这里的（属于项目特有配置）：
    Deliberately NOT placed here (these are project-specific):
      - TargetFramework   ：net8.0 / net10.0 / net10.0-windows 各不相同。
      - OutputType        ：WinExe / Exe / Library 各不相同。
      - ProjectReference / PackageReference / EmbeddedResource：每个项目不同。

    关于 TreatWarningsAsErrors：
    **已开启**（2026-10-11）。开启前提是仓库当时已是零警告——那 11 条唯一警告
    （HD2ModCore.Tests 9 条：4 条 CS0067 未使用事件、4 条 xUnit2031、1 条 xUnit2029；
    HD2ModManager 2 条：CS0649 未赋值字段）已全部清除，而不是被压制。
    这条护栏的价值在于：它让"新增一条警告"无法悄悄溜进来。
    About TreatWarningsAsErrors: now ON (2026-10-11). The prerequisite was a genuinely
    warning-free tree: the 11 unique warnings (9 in HD2ModCore.Tests, 2 in HD2ModManager)
    were cleared rather than suppressed. The point of the guardrail is that a new warning
    can no longer slip in unnoticed.

    关于 WarningsNotAsErrors（NU1901–NU1904）：
    这条护栏**只管编译警告，不管依赖漏洞**。NuGet 的审计警告默认会一起被升级为错误，
    但本项目是本地运行的单机 Mod 管理器，不对外提供服务、不处理不可信输入，
    因此"某个传递依赖存在已知漏洞"不构成需要中断构建的理由。
    把它排除在"错误"之外，是为了让**编译期**的零警告护栏保持锋利，同时不让
    **依赖公告**这种需要人判断的事情去挡构建。注意：排除的是"升级为错误"，
    警告本身仍会照常打印——只是不再让人没法构建。
    About WarningsNotAsErrors (NU1901-NU1904): the guardrail covers compiler warnings only,
    not dependency advisories. NuGet audit warnings would otherwise be escalated to errors too,
    but this is a local single-user mod manager that serves no network clients and takes no
    untrusted input, so a known CVE in a transitive dependency is not a reason to stop the build.
    Excluding them keeps the compile-time zero-warning guardrail sharp without letting advisory
    judgement calls block the build. They are demoted from errors, not silenced: the warnings
    still print.
  -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <Deterministic>true</Deterministic>
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>true</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
    <WarningsNotAsErrors>NU1901;NU1902;NU1903;NU1904</WarningsNotAsErrors>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!--
    CI 构建时启用确定性构建路径：PDB 中记录的是仓库相对路径而不是本机绝对路径，
    因此不同机器上的构建产物一致，堆栈跟踪也能在 CI 日志里正确对应到源码行。
    On CI, switch on deterministic build paths: PDBs record repository-relative paths instead of machine-local
    absolute paths, so artifacts match across machines and stack traces map back to source lines in CI logs.
  -->
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(CI)' == 'true'">
    <ContinuousIntegrationBuild>true</ContinuousIntegrationBuild>
  </PropertyGroup>

</Project>
